        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>penguin-politician</strong> trapped inside a closed arena that represents a country. Each round is a tactical struggle for influence. When you collide with other politicians, you compare your influence levels: the weaker one takes damage. Drop to zero? You’re out of the arena. A new contender takes your place — and the battle goes on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is not just to survive, but to <strong>tip the political scales in your favor</strong>. Empower allies, weaken opponents, push your ideology — and claim dominance over the state.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏛 <strong>Political Arenas</strong> — each country is a new map with unique rules and opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚖ <strong>Tactical Influence</strong> — contact clashes where stats and damage decide the outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Growing Power</strong> — strengthen allies to expand your sphere of influence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐧 <strong>Penguin Politicians</strong> — charismatic leaders of Arctic ideologies, each with unique traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Conquer the World</strong> — each captured country earns an achievement and brings you closer to global victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔄 <strong>Dynamic Opposition</strong> — defeated politicians leave, making way for new challengers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❄ Can you turn a cold political game into a blazing victory?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>penguin-politician</strong> trapped inside a closed arena that represents a country. Each round is a tactical struggle for influence. When you collide with other politicians, you compare your influence levels: the weaker one takes damage. Drop to zero? You’re out of the arena. A new contender takes your place — and the battle goes on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is not just to survive, but to <strong>tip the political scales in your favor</strong>. Empower allies, weaken opponents, push your ideology — and claim dominance over the state.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏛 <strong>Political Arenas</strong> — each country is a new map with unique rules and opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚖ <strong>Tactical Influence</strong> — contact clashes where stats and damage decide the outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Growing Power</strong> — strengthen allies to expand your sphere of influence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐧 <strong>Penguin Politicians</strong> — charismatic leaders of Arctic ideologies, each with unique traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Conquer the World</strong> — each captured country earns an achievement and brings you closer to global victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔄 <strong>Dynamic Opposition</strong> — defeated politicians leave, making way for new challengers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❄ Can you turn a cold political game into a blazing victory?</p>",
